      "writtenOn": "2026-08-25T23:42:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is true.  If Realtek really masked all interrupts, nothing could actually wake the EC from sleep mode.\n\nThe recurring 200ms tick and 1 second tick that run on the system workqueue should be waking up the EC at a minimum of these rates.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "827dcb7ebc559dfd0d1d3ee70d0310e521e3eaa7",
