      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T00:18:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was probably a little too overzealous saying all...before_rts5912_sleep() calls _disable_irq() masking at PRIMASK and does not call _enable_irq() until after_rts5912_sleep() which gets called after a wake. So the entire time you are in deep sleep anything below PRIMASK is not able to be fired. I will update the commit message for clarity",
      "parentUuid": "6f7a346b_09bba5de",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "827dcb7ebc559dfd0d1d3ee70d0310e521e3eaa7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
