      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T00:22:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This results in the watchdog warning IRQ never firing and in turn can lead to the watchdog firing while we are in deep sleep as there is nothing to reset it",
      "parentUuid": "cf43c323_33082cd4",
